Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W11_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W11_Flow23</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
