        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Store receives notification (tablet/terminal alert + printed pick list)
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W11_Flow23</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W11_Flow24</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W11_Task10" name="Stock Associate picks items from sales floor or backroom; scans each item to…">
