    <bpmn:process id="W_W19B" name="W19B. Ship from Store (Store-Fulfilled Home Delivery)" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Customer places home delivery order on website/app; nearest DC out of stock but nearby store has ATP
Frequency: ~1,000–2,000 ship-from-store orders/month; primarily bulky items (appliances, lumber, tiles) with limited DC coverage
Volume: Avg 1–3 items per order
Owner: Store Manager (store execution); DC Dispatch (carrier coordination)
Participants: System (order routing), Stock Associate (picker), DC Dispatch, 3PL Carrier, Customer
Source: workflow W19B — Ship from Store (Store-Fulfilled Home Delivery)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W19B_LaneSet6">
        <bpmn:lane id="W19B_Lane1" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W19B_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W19B_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W19B_Task15</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W19B_Task16</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W19B_Start7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W19B_Lane2" name="Supply Planner">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W19B_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W19B_Lane3" name="Stock Associate">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W19B_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W19B_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W19B_Lane4" name="DC Dispatch">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W19B_Task13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W19B_Lane5" name="Carrier">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W19B_Task14</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W19B_End17</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W19B_Start7" name="Customer places home delivery order on website/app; nearest DC out of stock but nearby…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W19B_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W19B_Task8" name="System evaluates order fulfillment options: (a) DC fulfillment (standard W19)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: System evaluates order fulfillment options: (a) DC fulfillment (standard W19) preferred, (b) if DC ATP = 0 for any line item, system checks ATP at stores within delivery radius of customer address, (c) if store ATP available, system offers ship-from-store as fulfillment option with estimated delivery date
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W19B_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W19B_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W19B_Task9" name="Supply Planner or DC Dispatch reviews ship-from-store suggestion; confirms…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Supply Planner or DC Dispatch reviews ship-from-store suggestion; confirms store has sufficient stock and store is not in a peak selling period (system shows store&#x27;s current day sales velocity); approves or overrides to wait for DC replenishment
Responsible (R): Supply Planner / DC Dispatch
Accountable (A): DC Supervisor
Duration: 5 min/order</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W19B_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W19B_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W19B_Task10" name="System routes order to selected store; creates store pick list with item…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: System routes order to selected store; creates store pick list with item locations; creates outbound shipment record
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W19B_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W19B_Flow23</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W19B_Task11" name="Store receives notification (tablet/terminal alert); Stock Associate picks…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Store receives notification (tablet/terminal alert); Stock Associate picks items from sales floor or backroom; scan-confirms each item
Responsible (R): Stock Associate
Accountable (A): Dept. Supervisor
Duration: 10–20 min/order</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W19B_Flow23</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W19B_Flow24</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W19B_Task12" name="Stock Associate stages picked items at store receiving/dispatch area; packs for…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Stock Associate stages picked items at store receiving/dispatch area; packs for shipping using packaging materials
Responsible (R): Stock Associate
Accountable (A): Dept. Supervisor
Duration: 10 min/order</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W19B_Flow24</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W19B_Flow25</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W19B_Task13" name="DC Dispatch creates delivery order with 3PL carrier (same W19.7 integration)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: DC Dispatch creates delivery order with 3PL carrier (same W19.7 integration); carrier picks up from store during scheduled route or on-demand
Responsible (R): DC Dispatch / Carrier
Accountable (A): DC Supervisor
Duration: 15 min/setup + pickup wait</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W19B_Flow25</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W19B_Flow26</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W19B_Task14" name="Carrier delivers to customer per standard W19.10; proof of delivery captured">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 7: Carrier delivers to customer per standard W19.10; proof of delivery captured
Responsible (R): Carrier
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Varies</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W19B_Flow26</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W19B_Flow27</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W19B_Task15" name="System marks order &quot;Delivered&quot;; inventory deducted at store location (not DC)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 8: System marks order &quot;Delivered&quot;; inventory deducted at store location (not DC); revenue recognized by Depot Inc. per standard ecommerce IC model (W14)
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W19B_Flow27</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W19B_Flow28</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W19B_Task16" name="If customer returns ship-from-store item: standard W12B (online return) or…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 9: If customer returns ship-from-store item: standard W12B (online return) or W19.12a (reverse logistics pickup) — item returns to the originating store (not DC) if store has capacity; otherwise to DC
Responsible (R): System / CSR
Accountable (A): Store Manager
Duration: Per W12/W19</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W19B_Flow28</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W19B_Flow29</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W19B_End17" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W19B_Flow29</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W19B_Annotation18">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-270 (ensure controlled execution — Order Fulfillment &amp; Delivery (PA-10.2).) | - operational: Store Manager (store execution); DC Dispatch (carrier coordination) review and approval gate
Owner: Store Manager (store execution); DC Dispatch (carrier coordination)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
