    <bpmn:process id="W_W210" name="W210. E-commerce Fulfillment Hub (Dark Store) Operations" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: High online order density in a specific urban zone; or DC congestion
Frequency: Daily operations
Volume: Covers selected &quot;Strategic Stores&quot; converted to Hubs; each hub processes ~50–80 online orders/day (vs. ~4 BOPIS orders/day at a standard store; 10–15 hubs ≈ 500–1,200 orders/day, within the ~1,430/day chain-wide ecommerce volume); initial rollout to 10–15 hubs in Metro Manila, Cebu, and Davao
Owner: Ecommerce Operations Manager
Participants: Hub Coordinator, Hub Pickers (3–5 per hub), Hub Packers (2–3 per hub), 3PL Couriers, Supply Planner, DC Dispatch
Source: workflow W210 — E-commerce Fulfillment Hub (Dark Store) Operations</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W210_LaneSet6">
        <bpmn:lane id="W210_Lane1" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W210_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W210_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W210_Start7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W210_Lane2" name="Hub Picker">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W210_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W210_Lane3" name="Hub Packer">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W210_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W210_Lane4" name="DC Dispatch">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W210_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W210_Lane5" name="Supply Planner">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W210_Task13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W210_End14</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W210_Start7" name="High online order density in a specific urban zone; or DC congestion">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W210_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W210_Task8" name="Hub Inventory Reservation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Hub Inventory Reservation: System prioritizes &quot;Hub-specific&quot; inventory for online orders; prevents &quot;walk-in&quot; sales of designated e-comm stock
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Real-time</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W210_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W210_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W210_Task9" name="Order Routing">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Order Routing: Intelligent routing engine assigns orders to the nearest Fulfillment Hub (Dark Store) to reduce last-mile cost (W19)
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Real-time</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W210_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W210_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W210_Task10" name="Wave Picking">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Wave Picking: Hub Pickers perform batch picking (multiple orders simultaneously) using RF guns (W3)
Responsible (R): Hub Picker
Accountable (A): Hub Coordinator
Duration: 20 min/wave</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W210_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W210_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W210_Task11" name="Packing &amp; QC">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Packing &amp; QC: Items verified and packed in the store&#x27;s &quot;Dark Zone&quot; (backroom or dedicated section)
Responsible (R): Hub Packer
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 5 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W210_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W210_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W210_Task12" name="Dispatch">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Dispatch: 3PL Couriers (Lalamove/Transportify) pick up directly from store backroom; avoids DC bottleneck
Responsible (R): DC Dispatch (at store)
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 10 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W210_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W210_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W210_Task13" name="Replenishment">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: Replenishment: Hub inventory replenished via priority DC-to-Store &quot;Push&quot; (W154) to ensure high ATP
Responsible (R): Supply Planner
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Daily</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W210_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W210_Flow23</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W210_End14" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W210_Flow23</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W210_Annotation15">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-270 (ensure controlled execution — Order Fulfillment &amp; Delivery (PA-10.2).) | - operational: standard operating procedures; system-enforced validation rules
Owner: Ecommerce Operations Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
