    <bpmn:process id="W_W247" name="W247. BOPIS Smart Locker &amp; Queue Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Ecommerce BOPIS order picked and staged (W11)
Frequency: Ongoing (daily)
Volume: ~4–5 BOPIS pickups per store/day (~25,700 BOPIS orders/month per profile §8.5)
Owner: Store Customer Experience Supervisor
Participants: Store Picker, Customer, Pro Desk Associate
Source: workflow W247 — BOPIS Smart Locker &amp; Queue Management</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W247_LaneSet5">
        <bpmn:lane id="W247_Lane1" name="Store Picker">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W247_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W247_Start6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W247_Lane2" name="Store Associate">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W247_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W247_Lane3" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W247_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W247_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W247_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W247_Lane4" name="Customer">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W247_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W247_End13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W247_Start6" name="Ecommerce BOPIS order picked and staged (W11)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W247_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W247_Task7" name="Staging">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Staging: Store Picker picks BOPIS order (W11 step 4). Stages the items in an in-store Smart Locker or Expedited Pick-up Counter rather than the backroom.
Responsible (R): Store Picker
Accountable (A): Store Mgr
Duration: 5 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W247_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W247_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W247_Task8" name="Locking &amp; Sync">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Locking &amp; Sync: Associate places the items in a designated smart locker; scans the locker QR code and links it to the order ID in the ERP system.
Responsible (R): Store Associate
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 3 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W247_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W247_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W247_Task9" name="Notification">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Notification: Locker system triggers an automated pickup PIN code and QR code to the customer&#x27;s email and mobile app (W11 step 6).
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W247_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W247_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W247_Task10" name="Customer Arrival">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Customer Arrival: Customer arrives at the store. (a) For Smart Locker: Scans the QR/enters the PIN at the locker screen; the locker door pops open. (b) For Pickup Counter: Customer checks in on a tablet queueing screen; Pro Desk is alerted.
Responsible (R): Customer
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 2 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W247_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W247_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W247_Task11" name="Reconciliation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Reconciliation: The locker door closing or the associate hand-off scan triggers a real-time order completion status in the ERP (W11 step 8).
Responsible (R): System / Associate
Accountable (A): Store Mgr
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W247_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W247_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W247_Task12" name="Feedback Loop">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: Feedback Loop: System sends an instant SMS survey asking for customer experience rating (CSAT W65).
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W247_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W247_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W247_End13" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W247_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W247_Annotation14">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-270 (ensure controlled execution — Order Fulfillment &amp; Delivery (PA-10.2).) | - operational: connectivity issues preventing locker opening
Owner: Store Customer Experience Supervisor</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W247_Assoc15" sourceRef="W247_Annotation14" targetRef="W247_Start6" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W247_Flow16" sourceRef="W247_Start6" targetRef="W247_Task7" />
