    <bpmn:process id="W_W1234" name="W1234. Customer E-Commerce Same-Day &amp; Next-Day Express Delivery Fulfillment" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Customer selects same-day or next-day delivery option during ecommerce checkout
Frequency: ~15–20% of ecommerce delivery orders request express; ~2,500–3,500 express orders/month
Volume: ~42,900 total ecommerce orders/month × 40% delivery × 18% express = ~3,100 express orders/month
Owner: Ecommerce Fulfillment Coordinator
Participants: Ecommerce Fulfillment Coordinator, Store Stock Associate, 3PL Rider (Lalamove, Transportify), Customer
Source: workflow W1234 — Customer E-Commerce Same-Day &amp; Next-Day Express Delivery Fulfillment</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1234_LaneSet5">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1234_Lane1" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1234_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1234_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1234_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1234_Start6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1234_Lane2" name="Stock Associate">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1234_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1234_Lane3" name="3PL Rider">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1234_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1234_Lane4" name="Ecommerce Fulfillment Coordinator">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1234_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1234_End13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1234_Start6" name="Customer selects same-day or next-day delivery option during ecommerce checkout">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1234_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1234_Task7" name="Express order routing">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Express order routing: System routes express order to nearest store with available inventory: (a) check real-time inventory per POS-013 event streaming; (b) if nearest store out of stock: check next nearest; (c) if no store stock: check DC with same-day dispatch capability; (d) assign fulfillment location and SLA (same-day or next-day)
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): Ecommerce Fulfillment Coordinator
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1234_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1234_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1234_Task8" name="Priority pick &amp; pack">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Priority pick &amp; pack: Store Stock Associate receives priority pick list (flagged as EXPRESS): (a) pick items from shelf immediately (interrupts regular replenishment); (b) pack items for transport (protective packaging for tiles, appliances, paint); (c) mark order ready for rider pickup in system; (d) SLA: pick within 30 minutes of order receipt
Responsible (R): Stock Associate
Accountable (A): Store Manager
Duration: 15–30 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1234_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1234_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1234_Task9" name="3PL rider dispatch">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: 3PL rider dispatch: (a) system auto-requests rider from Lalamove/Transportify API per W548; (b) rider dispatched to store; (c) rider arrives at store customer service counter; (d) Stock Associate hands over package with delivery receipt; (e) rider confirms pickup in BuildRight system
Responsible (R): System / 3PL Rider
Accountable (A): Ecommerce Fulfillment Coordinator
Duration: 15–30 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1234_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1234_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1234_Task10" name="In-transit tracking">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: In-transit tracking: (a) customer receives real-time tracking link; (b) GPS tracking per 3PL rider app; (c) system monitors delivery SLA countdown; (d) if rider delayed: alert customer with updated ETA; (e) escalation if delivery at risk of missing same-day window
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1234_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1234_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1234_Task11" name="Delivery confirmation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Delivery confirmation: (a) rider delivers to customer address; (b) customer signs/acknowledges receipt; (c) system marks order delivered; (d) photo proof of delivery captured by rider app; (e) system triggers customer satisfaction survey per W65
Responsible (R): 3PL Rider / Customer
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 5 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1234_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1234_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1234_Task12" name="Exception handling">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: Exception handling: (a) if customer not available: rider returns items to store; order reverts to standard delivery or BOPIS; (b) if item damaged in transit: process per W12B online returns; (c) if rider no-show: dispatch backup rider from alternative 3PL; (d) all exceptions logged for 3PL performance review per W242
Responsible (R): Ecommerce Fulfillment Coordinator
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 15 min/exception</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1234_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1234_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1234_End13" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1234_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1234_Annotation14">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-270 (ensure controlled execution — Order Fulfillment &amp; Delivery (PA-10.2).) | - operational: Ecommerce Fulfillment Coordinator review and approval gate
Owner: Ecommerce Fulfillment Coordinator</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W1234_Assoc15" sourceRef="W1234_Annotation14" targetRef="W1234_Start6" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1234_Flow16" sourceRef="W1234_Start6" targetRef="W1234_Task7" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1234_Flow17" sourceRef="W1234_Task7" targetRef="W1234_Task8" />
