    <bpmn:process id="W_W1441" name="W1441. Ecommerce Product Content Enrichment, How-To Guide Integration &amp; SEO Optimization for Home Improvement" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: New SKU onboarding (W50); or quarterly SEO performance review; or monthly product content audit revealing low-converting product pages
Frequency: Continuous as new SKUs onboard (~125–200 new SKUs/month per the 1,500–2,500/year canon); quarterly SEO review; monthly content audit
Volume: 35,000 active SKUs on ecommerce platform; ~125–200 new SKUs/month requiring content (per the canon Frequency); ~5,000 existing SKUs with below-benchmark conversion requiring enrichment per quarter
Owner: E-Commerce Content Manager
Participants: Content Manager, Product Photographer, SEO Specialist, Category Managers, PIM Administrator, External Content Agency
Source: workflow W1441 — Ecommerce Product Content Enrichment, How-To Guide Integration &amp; SEO Optimization for Home Improvement</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1441_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1441_Lane1" name="Content Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1441_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1441_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1441_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1441_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1441_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1441_Lane2" name="SEO Specialist">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1441_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1441_End10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1441_Start4" name="New SKU onboarding (W50); or quarterly SEO performance review; or monthly product content…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1441_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1441_Task5" name="New SKU content creation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: New SKU content creation: When a new SKU is onboarded per W50: (a) Category Manager provides technical specifications (dimensions, material, brand, application), (b) Product Photographer captures: (i) white-background product shot (primary image), (ii) in-situ/lifestyle photo (product installed or in use), (iii) detail shots (texture, finish, connector close-up), (iv) 360° rotation for key items (fixtures, appliances), (c) Content Manager writes: (i) product title optimized for search (&quot;buildright&quot; + category + brand + key spec), (ii) bullet-point specifications, (iii) installation notes, (iv) compatibility notes (&quot;fits standard ½&quot; PVC pipe&quot;), (d) SEO Specialist reviews title, description, and meta tags for keyword optimization
Responsible (R): Content Manager / Photographer
Accountable (A): E-Commerce Manager
Duration: 30–45 min per SKU</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1441_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1441_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1441_Task6" name="How-to guide integration">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: How-to guide integration: For complex product categories (plumbing, electrical, tile installation): (a) Content Manager creates or commissions how-to guides: (i) &quot;How to Install a Wall-Mounted Faucet&quot; with BuildRight product links, (ii) &quot;Complete Guide to Bathroom Renovation&quot; with shopping list builder, (iii) &quot;Electrical Wiring Basics for Homeowners&quot; with safety warnings, (b) integrate guides into product pages as &quot;Related Guides&quot; and &quot;Project Ideas&quot; sections, (c) guides link to all BuildRight products needed for the project (cross-sell), (d) guides published on buildright.com.ph/blog for organic search traffic
Responsible (R): Content Manager / Category Manager
Accountable (A): E-Commerce Manager
Duration: 4–8 hours per guide</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1441_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1441_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1441_Task7" name="Monthly content quality audit">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Monthly content quality audit: Content Manager audits product pages for: (a) missing images (target: 100% have primary image; 80% have lifestyle photo), (b) incomplete specifications (target: 100% have dimensions, material, brand), (c) pages with conversion rate below category average — flag for enrichment, (d) pages with high return rate — investigate if content is misleading, (e) pages with high traffic but low conversion — pricing or content issue, (f) prioritize top 500 SKUs by page views for enrichment first
Responsible (R): Content Manager
Accountable (A): E-Commerce Manager
Duration: 8 hours/month</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1441_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1441_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1441_Task8" name="Quarterly SEO performance review">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Quarterly SEO performance review: SEO Specialist reviews: (a) organic search traffic by category and keyword, (b) keyword ranking positions for target terms (&quot;home improvement Philippines&quot;, &quot;hardware store online&quot;, category-specific terms), (c) click-through rate from search results, (d) page load speed impact on search ranking, (e) identify keyword opportunities where BuildRight is not ranking on page 1, (f) recommend content updates, new guide topics, and link-building activities for next quarter
Responsible (R): SEO Specialist
Accountable (A): E-Commerce Manager
Duration: 8 hours/quarter</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1441_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1441_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1441_Task9" name="User-generated content curation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: User-generated content curation: Monitor and curate customer-generated content: (a) customer project photos tagged @buildright on social media — request permission to feature on product pages, (b) customer reviews with photos — highlight on product pages, (c) customer Q&amp;A — publish answers on product page for future customers, (d) content becomes social proof and improves SEO through fresh, unique content
Responsible (R): Content Manager
Accountable (A): E-Commerce Manager
Duration: 4 hours/month</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1441_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1441_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1441_End10" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1441_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1441_Annotation11">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-270 (ensure controlled execution — Order Fulfillment &amp; Delivery (PA-10.2).) | - operational: E-Commerce Content Manager review and approval gate
Owner: E-Commerce Content Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
